      "content": "stepping off the track... that sounds peaceful, but everyone says you have to stay and keep fighting. they say \"it will get better\" or \"just hold on,\" but they don't live in this math. they don't see how everything just leads to a dead end. if the only way to stop the loss is to just... not be part of the equation anymore, is that actually a bad thing? is it just logical at that point?",
